      "data": {
        "text": "**Planning the Providers**\n\nI've decided to standardize on Azure Cognitive Services Speech across all my Python scripts for text-to-speech tasks. This means I'll implement `synthesize_ssml.py` and `select_voice.py` using this service as well, for consistency with `synthesize_text.py`. Next, I'll be planning the providers in detail.\n\n\n**Defining the Providers**\n\nI've outlined the providers I'll utilize across the project. I've chosen Azure Cognitive Services Speech for several files, including `synthesize_ssml.py`, `select_voice.py`, and the speech-to-text aspect of `tts_qa_transcript.py`. I'll use Azure AI Translator for `script_translate.py`, Azure Content Moderator for `script_safety.py`, and Azure OpenAI Embeddings for `script_embedding.py`. Finally, `save_audio.py` will use the local file system. I'll create helper files first. Starting with `speech_client.py`, containing the Azure SpeechConfig setup.\n\n\n",
