      "data": {
        "text": "**Initiating SSML Synthesis**\n\nI'm now diving into the \"SAME-SC ENARIO\" scored files, mirroring Azure Cognitive Services Speech. The next focus is on `synthesize_ssml.py`, where I'll implement SSML synthesis, leveraging `azure.cognitiveservices`.\n\n\n**Developing SSML Implementation**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on `synthesize_ssml.py`, my main focus right now. The goal is to synthesize SSML leveraging `azure.cognitiveservices.speech`, aiming for parity with the existing text-to-speech implementation. I'm making sure to mirror Azure Cognitive Services Speech's approach with the \"SAME-SC ENARIO\" test files.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
