      "data": {
        "text": "**Listing Available Voices**\n\nI'm now focusing on implementing `select_voice.py`. My aim is to list available voices for a specific target locale. I plan to leverage the `azure.cognitiveservices.speech` library, which provides the necessary functionality to query available voices.\n\n\n",
