        "text": "**Defining Audio Persistence**\n\nI'm now focusing on `save_audio.py`. My current plan is straightforward; use standard Python file I/O. I intend to write the synthesized audio bytes to a local file. This should be a fairly simple and direct process.\n\n\n",
