      "data": {
        "text": "**Implementing Translation Step**\n\nI'm now focusing on the \"LATER-STEP\" scored files. Specifically, I'm working on the `script_translate.py` file. I'm planning to leverage Azure AI Translator to handle the necessary translation of narration scripts prior to synthesis.\n\n\n",
